  "body": "This Pull Request updates dependency [node-sass](https://github.com/sass/node-sass) from `v4.5.3` to `v4.6.1`\n\n\n### Commits\n\n<details>\n<summary>sass/node-sass</summary>\n\n#### 4.6.1\n-   [`6b7b679`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/6b7b67901bc7c1f803073089ad93b95ec5fc61d4) 4.6.1\n-   [`824fbd5`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/824fbd5f76506d8314d64198273b6fcf2d121ad9) gaze.watched returns an object (#&#8203;2147)\n-   [`82ac87f`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/82ac87fb4808b320b58591ac0f4b9f5c199594bd) Update changelog for 4.6.0 (#&#8203;2141)\n-   [`56a19a5`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/56a19a5adb3b676807f39e898818a129a8edfd49) docs: Update the Node version support message (#&#8203;2136)\n#### 4.6.0\n-   [`54f9873`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/54f9873c99dbb2dab2c6443dcf25b6c2ef1414ae) 4.6.0\n-   [`0e8ce9c`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/0e8ce9c02b34506a730aed51fdf909dfc23afb57) Build: Add Node 9 to Appveyor\n-   [`82dc901`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/82dc901c6876660cc5253f598afb157f2935f297) Install: Add Node 9 detection\n-   [`8110422`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/811042218f709bb26267f24df50a5acbc542429a) build: Add Node 8 (carbon) to Travis\n-   [`f6b0c72`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/f6b0c7226460abbe8fc430b86c2af73cb7130664) [LEAK FIX] Use Nan::ObjectWrap to handle memory management\n-   [`3052263`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/3052263f1d1cd7529fad68547f8d2bafc77d7c84) [LEAK FIX] create_string must be paired with a free\n-   [`4cf43ac`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/4cf43ac99a8113a14d1c6fe0a999fb53606d5a51) Remove dangling console.log from tests\n-   [`930c2d9`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/930c2d9fa7657578a68b0472cb1186665832d32c) Backfill some test for sass.types.*\n-   [`f2a09eb`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/f2a09eb02c44312ad556041799fe80f40e4d6d5f) Add Isolated Memory Leak Scenarios\n-   [`74242dc`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/74242dc291de68a4e0d01a99f0a11c3a3604a026) Merge pull request #&#8203;2127 from foladipo/patch-1\n-   [`aa5bbbf`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/aa5bbbf20917d145bc697fcaf81b11fb459fa13e) improve grammar/clarity of instructions\n-   [`e934a55`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/e934a55d5a0433e8e1d483a485c4717c9a416b6c) Remove Node 0.10 and 0.12 from CI config (#&#8203;2112)\n-   [`6ed334b`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/6ed334be3f0590e7dbdf4de7597b7d64e708acf2) Add workaround for Node &lt; 4 support with v4.x\n-   [`9e18803`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/9e18803a3dfefd2a8941bb40bbb094ade03ceeca) docs: Fix broken anchor for Functions\n-   [`4a0f3d0`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/4a0f3d028c81ab355b9d2b75b76da14e7bf13725) docs: README formatting and spelling fixes (#&#8203;2063)\n-   [`5392533`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/5392533e17363d1c00affd2e5c756c8e83003c69) chore: add NPM 5 troubleshooting (#&#8203;2036)\n-   [`a219c8c`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/a219c8cf031be5b2d73f3a70355a038056409204) Fix broken link to CONTRIBUTING.md\n-   [`4f9b667`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/4f9b667b462cbd1133e7e8802dacb45d0fe5c640) docs: Replace VS 2013 requirement with node-gyp (#&#8203;2028)\n-   [`74179fc`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/74179fcf07073d4494fdb65fcc09bccc547eef3c) Fix test exclusion\n-   [`59fb078`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/59fb078766d67d78a118159fba6cb3bd93fadf65) Pass &quot;follow&quot; option to sass-graph\n-   [`72ab73b`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/72ab73b7988ae306d36c15043a1e034d226ecc0f) Bump sass-graph@&#8203;2.2.4 (#&#8203;1958)\n-   [`aadf8d4`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/aadf8d47560a8a44f6d6180e5d7f43b7fbe6f792) Decouple the graph and render logic from the fs watcher (#&#8203;2020)\n-   [`61d7e1c`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/61d7e1c1abf762aad22bb2a6b3fdac884ca369bd) Fix spelling of &quot;synchronously&quot; in README.md (#&#8203;2015)\n-   [`0d5a740`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/0d5a74004ef25684a5ba38f1c69ae07c80d8ac42) Merge pull request #&#8203;2009 from piotrowski/patch-2\n-   [`750573a`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/750573a6e607e9adbe5e04a171bfb08391193ec7) Readme: Add Node v8 as supported (#&#8203;2008)\n-   [`528ac44`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/528ac44ec88479c9a75d87712f75ce21d70cc792) Readme: Fix typo in alt text of Slack Badge\n-   [`bb45385`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/bb45385ae8bfe2c66ebb907ed9cc11e4772db8c3) Merge pull request #&#8203;1999 from jhermsmeier/electron-abis\n-   [`a1488f1`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/a1488f1ecc3db2acc208c17f296773e958cffc16) Add Electron ABI versions\n-   [`1dcc78a`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/1dcc78acce4243a8014b0f23806bccd2aa328cbd) Move GitHub files under .github folder (#&#8203;1997)\n-   [`593d1fa`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/593d1fa9e5a830b7136e2d6a0814227da5e965b1) Chore: Add Node 8 to Appveyor (#&#8203;1987)\n-   [`6331ad8`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/6331ad82eba76379e1646c60590d8b5dc327faf9) Chore: Add back Node 7 to Travis (#&#8203;1986)\n-   [`fcd29e9`](https://github.com/sass/node-sass/commit/fcd29e92b4a5351c827c7cac61281a2bee05ecab) Build: Use Travis Stages (#&#8203;1977)\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovateapp.com).",
